#: ConfigEditJson.qml:24
msgid ""
"Edit the menu structure as JSON. Each item can have: name, icon, command "
"(run through the shell) or action (a session action: lock, logout, leave, "
"switchUser, suspend, hibernate, reboot, shutdown), submenu (array of items), "
"or separator (true)."
msgstr ""
"Modifiez la structure du menu au format JSON. Chaque élément peut avoir : "
"name, icon, command (exécutée via le shell) ou action (une action de "
"session : lock, logout, leave, switchUser, suspend, hibernate, reboot, "
"shutdown), submenu (tableau d'éléments) ou separator (true)."

